    "getStartedInstructions": "1. Install [STM32CubeCLT](https://www.st.com/en/development-tools/stm32cubeclt.html).\n2. Power the board through USB-C, then connect an ST-Link to the SWD header.\n3. Run `build_and_flash.bat`.\n4. To change the UI, open `lvgl_ui_project` in the LVGL Pro Editor, export it with Ctrl+E, and run `build_and_flash.bat` again.",
